{"name":"Melancholic Macaw","hex":"#aa1133","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"melancholic","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Filled with or affected by melancholy—great sadness or depression, especially of a thoughtful or introspective nature.","Pertaining to black bile (melancholy)."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person who is habitually melancholy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/melancholic"},{"term":"macaw","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of various parrots of the genera Ara, Anodorhynchus, Cyanopsitta, Orthopsittaca, Primolius and Diopsittaca of Central and South America, including the largest parrots and characterized by long sabre-shaped tails, curved powerful bills, and usually brilliant plumage."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/macaw"}],"entries":[{"title":"Melancholia","blocks":[{"text":"Melancholia or melancholy is a concept found throughout ancient, medieval, and premodern medicine in Europe that describes a condition characterized by markedly depressed mood, bodily complaints, and sometimes hallucinations and delusions. Besides a pathological condition, melancholy could also refer to a mood or temperament and at times it was even used as a description of the human condition in general."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/A_man_whose_face_exemplifies_the_melancholy_temperament._Dra_Wellcome_V0009108ER.jpg/330px-A_man_whose_face_exemplifies_the_melancholy_temperament._Dra_Wellcome_V0009108ER.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melancholia"},{"title":"Macaw","blocks":[{"text":"Macaws are a group of large New World parrots that are long-tailed and often colorful, in the tribe Arini. They are popular in aviculture or as companion parrots, although there are conservation concerns about several species in the wild."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Ara_macao%2C_Ara_ararauna_and_Ara_militaris.jpg/330px-Ara_macao%2C_Ara_ararauna_and_Ara_militaris.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Macaw"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/Albrecht_D%C3%BCrer_-_Melencolia_I_-_Google_Art_Project_%28_AGDdr3EHmNGyA%29.jpg/500px-Albrecht_D%C3%BCrer_-_Melencolia_I_-_Google_Art_Project_%28_AGDdr3EHmNGyA%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/Albrecht_D%C3%BCrer_-_Melencolia_I_-_Google_Art_Project_%28_AGDdr3EHmNGyA%29.jpg/1280px-Albrecht_D%C3%BCrer_-_Melencolia_I_-_Google_Art_Project_%28_AGDdr3EHmNGyA%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/Albrecht_D%C3%BCrer_-_Melencolia_I_-_Google_Art_Project_%28_AGDdr3EHmNGyA%29.jpg/500px-Albrecht_D%C3%BCrer_-_Melencolia_I_-_Google_Art_Project_%28_AGDdr3EHmNGyA%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Melencolia I by Albrecht Dürer, 1514","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAlbrecht_D%C3%BCrer_-_Melencolia_I_-_Google_Art_Project_(_AGDdr3EHmNGyA).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Robert_Burton%27s_Anatomy_of_Melancholy%2C_1626%2C_2nd_edition.jpg/500px-Robert_Burton%27s_Anatomy_of_Melancholy%2C_1626%2C_2nd_edition.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Robert_Burton%27s_Anatomy_of_Melancholy%2C_1626%2C_2nd_edition.jpg/1280px-Robert_Burton%27s_Anatomy_of_Melancholy%2C_1626%2C_2nd_edition.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Robert_Burton%27s_Anatomy_of_Melancholy%2C_162